// on-device AI workspace for iPhone, iPad, Apple Silicon Mac, and Apple Vision Pro with 200+
// downloadable local models (GGUF via llama.cpp, plus MLX). Not to be confused with the
// separate, single-fixed-model paid app "AI on Device" by Eduardo Dominguez Menendez, already
